===Etymology===
From Old Galician and {{inh|gl|roa-opt|puta}}, probably from {{der|gl|VL.|*putta}}, variant of {{m|la|puta}}, female form of {{m|la|puttus}}, {{m|la|putus|t=boy}}.<ref>{{R:DCECH|puta}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
