===Noun===
{{gl-noun|f}}

# {{lb|gl|vulgar|pejorative}} [[whore]]
#: {{syn|gl|prostituta}}
# {{lb|gl|vulgar|pejorative}} [[slut]]
#* '''1459''', Anselmo López Carreira (ed.), ''Fragmentos de notarios'', [http://gmh.consellodacultura.org/nc/buscador/resultados/lib/5/buscar/puta/dende/Dende%2BAAAA/ata/Ata%2BAAAA/infodoc/5%7CD164/envio/BUSCAR/op/1/fb0/0/ doc. 164];
